WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:05.204
-Dwayne, Jungle Cruise is pretty
legendary as far as rides go.

00:00:05.204 --> 00:00:07.273
Or any Disney fan knows.

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:09.275
I might have been --
I might be wrong.

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:11.310
Was it the first ride
that he did

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:12.945
or the first attraction he did,
or no?

00:00:12.945 --> 00:00:15.849
-Yes. Yes, you know
your history very well.

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:18.250
In 1955, when Disneyland opened,

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.787
Jungle Cruise was
Walt Disney's baby.

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:22.055
-Yeah.

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:25.691
-And he wanted to create a ride,
an experience for people

00:00:25.691 --> 00:00:28.194
that they could experience what
it's like around the world,

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:31.197
on the Amazon,
and for those families

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:34.600
who weren't able
to travel the world.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:37.070
So Jungle Cruise
was Walt's baby.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:39.439
And as a matter of fact,
here's some cool history.

00:00:39.439 --> 00:00:43.776
The very first Jungle Cruise
skipper, in 1955,

00:00:43.776 --> 00:00:47.213
when the park opened,
unbeknownst to a lot of fans

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:49.715
who went that day,
was Walt Disney himself.

00:00:49.715 --> 00:00:51.317
-No way!
[ Audience oohs ]

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:52.985
-Yeah.
-That's wild.

00:00:52.985 --> 00:00:54.921
And that's who you play
in the movie.

00:00:54.921 --> 00:00:56.456
I mean, you don't play Walt
Disney, but you're the skipper.

00:00:56.456 --> 00:00:58.657
[ Laughter ]
-I was so excited about this.

00:00:58.657 --> 00:01:03.663
And honestly I had one --
I had one human being in mind

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:05.965
to be my co-star, and that was
always Emily Blunt.

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:08.601
-Really? Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:10.503
You guys --
I can't wait to see this,

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:13.205
but you guys spent, obviously --

00:01:13.205 --> 00:01:15.207
She's super funny as well.
-She is.

00:01:15.207 --> 00:01:16.742
-I know she has a great
sense of humor. Yeah.

00:01:16.742 --> 00:01:19.579
-She's super talented.
She's a multi-threat.

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:21.380
And we became great friends.

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:24.551
I love her. I love her family.
John, their kids.

00:01:24.551 --> 00:01:30.423
We're all one big ohana, as we
like to say on the islands.

00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:32.825
And I can't wait for everybody
to see her in this movie

00:01:32.825 --> 00:01:36.095
because she truly is
the female version of --

00:01:36.095 --> 00:01:37.396
and this is saying a lot --

00:01:37.396 --> 00:01:39.865
but she truly is the female
version of Indiana Jones.

00:01:39.865 --> 00:01:41.066
I'm very proud of her

00:01:41.066 --> 00:01:42.936
and how much she kicks ass
in this movie.

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:44.303
-I want to show everyone a clip.

00:01:44.303 --> 00:01:47.540
Here's Dwayne Johnson and
Emily Blunt in "Jungle Cruise."

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:49.708
Take a look at this.

00:01:49.708 --> 00:01:53.679
-Come on. I got your pants.
Trust me.

00:01:53.679 --> 00:01:56.148
Hold on!
-[ Screams ]

00:01:56.148 --> 00:02:00.686 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:00.686 --> 00:02:03.789
Frank. Frank, get it.

00:02:03.789 --> 00:02:05.425
-Hold on.
-Come on.

00:02:07.226 --> 00:02:08.228
Frank, please.
-I got it.

00:02:08.228 --> 00:02:09.729
-Frank!
-I don't got it.

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:13.232 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:13.232 --> 00:02:14.934
-Frank, get off me!
What are you doing?

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:16.769
-I'm trying to get traction.
-This is ridiculous!

00:02:16.769 --> 00:02:18.271
-Oh, no. Wait.
-Just leave me alone.

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:20.205
That was a disaster.
-You're too heavy.

00:02:20.205 --> 00:02:23.709
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:23.709 --> 00:02:26.078
-Come on! That's a movie.

00:02:26.078 --> 00:02:28.481
That's what I want to see.
Dwayne Johnson, everybody!

00:02:28.481 --> 00:02:31.651
"Jungle Cruise" is in theaters
and on Disney+

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:34.087
with Premier Access July 30th.

